     "sacred grove",
     "conserve",
     "pilgrim"
    ],
    "text": {
     "en": "Many places are sacred because of their link with nature: rivers like the Ganga, mountains like Kailash and groves of trees. Sacred groves protect plants, animals and water.\nPilgrimages create jobs for guides, shopkeepers and boatmen and bring money to towns. But crowds can create waste and damage.\nWe must restore and conserve sacred places, keeping them clean and respecting local rules."
    }
